    "name": "Grave Bros",
    "steam_appid": 3690910,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690910/extras/459740acbb63f49d381df0d1415f378e.poster.avif?t=1752938838\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690910/extras/459740acbb63f49d381df0d1415f378e.webm?t=1752938838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690910/extras/459740acbb63f49d381df0d1415f378e.mp4?t=1752938838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690910/extras/de24139b674712ffbffbb1b448563eff.avif?t=1752938838\" width=690 height=196 /></span><br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <strong>\ud83e\udea6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grave Bros is a laughter-filled parkour adventure. As two players carry a coffin together, sometimes you'll need to proceed in unison, and other times you'll have to temporarily split up to clear the path. Knowing when to share the load and when to separate and reunite is crucial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step is a challenge, every jump a risk, and every fall... pure comedy. Stay balanced, think fast, and \u2014 if possible \u2014 try not to drop Grandma along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690910/extras/b14dfa75cf4450287cf32b21d5bbfc5d.poster.avif?t=1752938838\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690910/extras/b14dfa75cf4450287cf32b21d5bbfc5d.webm?t=1752938838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690910/extras/b14dfa75cf4450287cf32b21d5bbfc5d.mp4?t=1752938838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690910/extras/97f5ca91515f3d7d69c5ba275c666918.avif?t=1752938838\" width=690 height=196 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>\ud83d\udc6c</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's standout feature is the ability to switch between carrying the coffin together and progressing individually. Some obstacles require synchronized movement, while others necessitate one player leaving the coffin behind to press a button or open a path. Then, reunite, share the load, and continue your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordination, trust, and lots of laughter are essential parts of this adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690910/extras/2cd7d2638788c2205b4e29baeb43674f.poster.avif?t=1752938838\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690910/extras/2cd7d2638788c2205b4e29baeb43674f.webm?t=1752938838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690910/extras/2cd7d2638788c2205b4e29baeb43674f.mp4?t=1752938838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83c\udfaf Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two-player cooperative gameplay with local or online co-op support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humorous and surprise-filled obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful, witty, and energetic visual style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're stumbling or soaring through the air, Grave Bros offers a journey full of friendship, cooperation, and guaranteed laughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready? Because you can only reach this grave together.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690910/extras/459740acbb63f49d381df0d1415f378e.poster.avif?t=1752938838\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690910/extras/459740acbb63f49d381df0d1415f378e.webm?t=1752938838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690910/extras/459740acbb63f49d381df0d1415f378e.mp4?t=1752938838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690910/extras/de24139b674712ffbffbb1b448563eff.avif?t=1752938838\" width=690 height=196 /></span><br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <strong>\ud83e\udea6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grave Bros is a laughter-filled parkour adventure. As two players carry a coffin together, sometimes you'll need to proceed in unison, and other times you'll have to temporarily split up to clear the path. Knowing when to share the load and when to separate and reunite is crucial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step is a challenge, every jump a risk, and every fall... pure comedy. Stay balanced, think fast, and \u2014 if possible \u2014 try not to drop Grandma along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690910/extras/b14dfa75cf4450287cf32b21d5bbfc5d.poster.avif?t=1752938838\" wi