m_assets/steam/apps/3690910/extras/2cd7d2638788c2205b4e29baeb43674f.mp4?t=1752938838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83c\udfaf Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two-player cooperative gameplay with local or online co-op support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humorous and surprise-filled obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful, witty, and energetic visual style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're stumbling or soaring through the air, Grave Bros offers a journey full of friendship, cooperation, and guaranteed laughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready? Because you can only reach this grave together.</p>",
